-- order reversal for the field term: with u the inverse of 4k and v the inverse of 4k − s (u·4k = 1, v·(4k − s) = 1 on the net), v − u = s·u·v; free form: v·(4k·u) − u·((4k − s)·v) = s·u·v. Variables k, s, u, v.
dz-inv : (A : Type) → (A → A → A) → (A → A → A) → (BQ → A) → List A → A × A
dz-inv A ad mu q vs = (λ g sub → (sub (mu (g 3) (mu (mu (q (fn-q 4 1)) (g 0)) (g 2))) (mu (g 2) (mu (sub (mu (q (fn-q 4 1)) (g 0)) (g 1)) (g 3))) , mu (g 1) (mu (g 2) (g 3)))) (λ i → al-nth A (q (fn-q 0 1)) i vs) (al-gsub A ad mu q)
